<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Acolyte Heal Skill Spam for Party of 2 Members</Major>
    <Description>
Macro Name: Divine Healer’s Harmony – 2-Party Member Edition

__________________________________________________________________________

Description:

This macro is tailored for Acolytes, Priests, High Priests, Arch Bishops, and Cardinals who seek to master the art of healing in Ragnarok Online. Designed for party configurations with 2 members, this setup ensures uninterrupted healing efficiency, allowing players to focus on strategy and support without the stress of manual spamming.

Whether you're holding the frontline or aiding an ally in a heated battle, this macro is your ultimate healing companion, maximizing both gameplay efficiency and enjoyment.

________________________________________________________________________

Supported Job Classes:
     + Acolyte / Priest / High Priest / Arch Bishop / Cardinal


Skill Focus:
     +Heal (Levels 1 to 10)

Conditions:
     + Party configuration: 2 members
___________________________________________________________________________


Step-by-Step Tutorial for Macro Setup:
1. Assign Heal Skill to "F":
     + Set your Heal skill (at any level from 1 to 10) to the "F" key on your keyboard.
     + For optimal visual alignment, adjust your game’s Graphic Resolution Setting to 1600 x 900.

2. Position the Ragnarok Game Window:
     + Ensure your Ragnarok Online game window is positioned at the top-left corner of your screen. 
     + This placement is critical for the macro to function smoothly and accurately.

3. Party Setup:
     + Create a party by pressing Alt + Z to open the Party Member List window.
     + Add your second party member to ensure they receive consistent heals during gameplay.

4. Window Arrangement:
     + Keep the Party Member List window open and place it below your fully expanded shortcut keys window (1, 2, 3, 4 lanes visible). 
     + This arrangement allows the macro to detect the correct targets and ensure efficient healing.

5. Activate the Macro:
     + Assign this macro to your preferred key within Keyran.
     + Set the Operating Mode to "Run until pressed again."

6. Ready to Heal:
     + With everything in place, you’re all set to spam Heal continuously on yourself and your party member without lifting a finger! Watch as your team’s health stays at peak levels, even during the most intense battles.

_____________________________________________________________________________

Upcoming Version Announcement:

Stay tuned for the Spam Heal for Party of 3 edition! Perfect for larger group support scenarios, ensuring every party member receives divine care!

____________________________________________________________________________

Special Thanks to Keyran:

Your innovative platform has truly revolutionized the gaming experience. 
With Keyran, tedious tasks become seamless, stress-free, and incredibly enjoyable. 

Thank you for empowering us with tools that make every adventure a joy!

____________________________________________________________________________
</Description>
